<title>THAILAND: TABLE-AMERICAN STANDARD Q2 NET LOWER.</title>
<headline>TABLE-AMERICAN STANDARD Q2 NET LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     8.45	 vs	   9.28</p>
<p>    Net		     63.40	 vs	  69.61</p>
<p>				   Six months</p>
